# React / components (`apps/web`)

**Methodology:** [`docs/meta/ai_first_project_methodology.md`](docs/meta/ai_first_project_methodology.md)  
**Guides:** [ai_component_guidelines.md](docs/guidelines/react/ai_component_guidelines.md), [ai_react_hooks_guidelines.md](docs/guidelines/react/ai_react_hooks_guidelines.md), [ai_react_utilities_guidelines.md](docs/guidelines/react/ai_react_utilities_guidelines.md)  
**Naming:** **react-naming-conventions** · **Logic/presentation:** **react-logic-presentation**

## Server vs client

- **Server Components by default** — no `'use client'`.
- **`'use client'`** only for hooks, DOM events, client-only APIs; directive at **top of file**.
- Prefer `.client.tsx` / `.client.ts` for new client-entry modules.

## Domain literals

- **No inline domain strings** — roles, booking statuses, enum codes.
- Import from `@/lib/...` or `@pulse/domain`.
- **User-visible text** → `@/lib/messages` (**ui-messages-and-copy**).

## Components

- Explicit **props interfaces**; **no `React.FC`** for new components.
- Arrow components `const X = (props: Props) => …` (exceptions: `page.tsx`, `layout.tsx`, `'use server'`).
- Primitives in `components/ui/`; features in dedicated folders.

## Styling

- Tailwind + **`cn()`** from `@/lib/utils`; variants via **cva**.
- Semantic tokens per **ui-warm-forest-shadcn** and [`fitness-platform-design-system.md`](docs/default_docs/fitness-platform-design-system.md).

## Structure

- **One feature component per file:** **react-one-component-per-file** (≤ **140 lines** target)
- **Maximize shared components** — search `components/ui/`, `components/atoms/`, domain folders before inline JSX; extract on 2+ routes (**react-logic-presentation**)
- Named exports for shared components; avoid deep barrel chains.

## Forms & mutations

- [ai_form_handling_pattern.md](docs/guidelines/react/ai_form_handling_pattern.md)
- Toast: **ui-toast-mutations**; pending: **ui-mutation-pending**

## React Compiler

When `reactCompiler: true` in `next.config.ts` — do not add `memo` / `useCallback` / `useMemo` without profiled need. Follow [Rules of React](https://react.dev/reference/rules).

## shadcn/ui

Use **shadcn MCP** before hand-rolling primitives. Adapt to Warm Forest tokens. Prefer Radix-based primitives for a11y (**ui-semantics-a11y**).

## Semantics & a11y

- **Semantic HTML + WCAG 2.1 AA** — **ui-semantics-a11y**; guide: [ai_semantics_a11y_guidelines.md](docs/guidelines/react/ai_semantics_a11y_guidelines.md)
- Native `<button>`, `<a>`, `<label>`, landmarks — not div-as-button
- Icon-only: `aria-label`; decorative lucide: `aria-hidden`

Reference: lampto `react-ui-components.mdc` — Pulse design system paths.
